    "domains from a public source with a compatible licence (DuckDuckGo Tracker",
    "Radar, Apache-2.0; or EasyPrivacy, GPLv3 / CC BY-SA 3.0) and record the source",
    "and licence here. Keep the total under ~5000 entries for lookup performance."
  ],
